{"detail": {"templateUuid": "8f2156ee29bb4becb14dfe7fb6800fb4", "projectUuid": "25a8423ee6d34eafa1f1a0ad8c5fdadb", "name": "失重游乐园", "description": "你上一次感受到失重是在什么时候？\n是在跳楼机突然下坠的那一刻，还是过山车冲上最高点、身体被短暂抛起的时候？\n你喜欢那种 短暂脱离重力的感觉吗？\n\n《失重乐园》这个短片，其实就是把 游乐园里那些瞬间产生的失重体验，转化成一个可以被看见的空间。\n在这个世界里，重力消失了，很多东西都漂浮在空中：\n水浪卷成圆形停在天上，小孩在空中钓鱼；\n大象、热气球、马戏团装置像气球一样飘着；\n还有很多游乐园里的东西——旋转木马、滑滑梯、玩具、小球——慢慢漂浮在天空里。\n\n整个世界就像一个 轻盈、梦幻，又有点迷幻的游乐园空间。", "coverUrl": "/assets/30813735d9b831a8.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/cfa4d320997449429d70dd19c2a9c6e4/a1e3249cdd6c47791dada237ce6516c3f6f98fbe.mp4", "snapshotId": 812, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 4037558, "ownerUuid": "cfa4d320997449429d70dd19c2a9c6e4", "avatar": "/assets/b6a1db6e7e0fa534.webp", "nickname": "KKAI生成影像", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 227, "tags": [{"id": 1202, "code": "style_aesthetic", "tagLabel": "风格美学", "parentTag": 1200, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1200/1202/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 2, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 1000, "code": "selected", "tagLabel": "精选画布", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1000/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5001, "name": "先锋", "icon": "/assets/15bcb4d002b68470.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/b40570481582e92f.webp", "desc": "LibTV先锋作者", "verifyLevel": 1}], "score": 0, "createAt": "2026年03月18日 17:49", "updateAt": "2026年04月23日 00:43", "publishAt": "2026年03月18日 23:30", "playCount": 54, "viewCreationProcessCount": 24, "copyCanvasCount": 4, "shareCount": 1, "snapshotPath": "/data/canvas-snapshots/8f2156ee29bb4becb14dfe7fb6800fb4.json.gz", "snapshotSummary": {"nodes": 101, "edges": 81}}, "recommendList": []}